<title>UK: Korea Development Bank sets 1.5 billion FRF bond.</title>
<headline>Korea Development Bank sets 1.5 billion FRF bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    05.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.771    PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.771    SPREAD	+33 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMS US/UK/FR/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
